# Backend Internal Service Origin
# Used strictly in Server Components for server-to-server data fetching (e.g. public toppers).
# - Development default: http://127.0.0.1:3001 (if unset in development)
# - Production: MUST be explicitly set to the private network URL or origin of the backend service.
# NOTE: Never prefix with NEXT_PUBLIC_ to prevent leaking internal infrastructure to client bundles.
BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3001
